'Tests.OnlineConvexFirstOrder.loss_domain' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
Tests.OnlineConvexFirstOrder.loss_convex : BanditRL.OnlineConvex.IsConvexExtended Tests.OnlineConvexFirstOrder.loss
